# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Inkcast studio — environment
#
# EVERY VARIABLE HERE IS OPTIONAL. Copy this file to `.env.local` only if you
# want to opt into a cloud upgrade. With no `.env.local` at all the studio runs
# the fully local pipeline: heuristic planner, Kokoro ONNX voice, built-in icon
# set. That is the supported default path, not a fallback.
#
#   cp apps/web/.env.example apps/web/.env.local
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Where projects live ---------------------------------------------------
# Per-project working directories (`storyboard.json`, `audio/`, `frames/`,
# `out.mp4`). Relative paths resolve from the repo root. Consumed by
# @inkcast/core's `PROJECTS_ROOT`.
# INKCAST_PROJECTS=projects

# --- Logging ---------------------------------------------------------------
# One of: debug | info | warn | error. Shared with the CLI via
# @inkcast/core's `logger`.
# INKCAST_LOG=info

# --- Optional: cloud planning ----------------------------------------------
# Without this the planner uses its deterministic, structure-aware heuristic.
# With it, storyboard planning and natural-language storyboard edits go through
# Claude. Absence logs one warning line and degrades; it never crashes.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- Optional: cloud voice -------------------------------------------------
# Without this, narration is synthesised locally with Kokoro ONNX.
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=

# --- Optional: cloud image synthesis ---------------------------------------
# Without these, visuals come from the built-in icon set plus procedural
# diagram layout. Set at most one.
# REPLICATE_API_TOKEN=
# FAL_KEY=

# --- Public (inlined into the browser bundle) ------------------------------
# Only set this if the studio is served from somewhere other than the origin
# the browser loaded it from. Never put a secret behind a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_INKCAST_BASE_URL=
